abstract: Revised fixed transcription of 設醫原由, Bodleian Sinica6530, limited to the
  single official recto. Four source-visible punctuation marks are inserted and seven
  provisional glyph readings are retained with candidates. One source-only reading
  was sealed before comparison; the same reader later performed nonblind image adjudication,
  not a third blind group. Catalogue date [1880s?], place [Hankou?], exact year and
  historical author remain uncertain or unknown. Historical-document digitization
  only. Revised after independent AI reading, complete comparison and source-image
  adjudication. No human double collation, expert review, peer review or measured
  accuracy is claimed.
